ned in other languages, e.g. French showed \\\"Activé\\\" while the toggle was off.\\n\\nThis could lead a clinician to believe structured dosing was selected while they were actually typing into the free-text box, which is how orders with no dose, route, frequency or duration were ending up saved and stuck in Active Medications.\\n\\nThe cause was the labels passed to Carbon's `Toggle` in `drug-order-form.component.tsx`. Carbon shows `labelA` when unchecked and `labelB` when checked, and we had them the other way round. I swapped them so the label now matches the toggle state, and added a test that checks the label text in both states. No translation changes are needed since the `on` / `off` keys already exist.\\n\\n## Screenshots\\n\\nFree text dosage switched on, label now reads \\\"On\\\":\\n\\n<img width=\\\"636\\\" height=\\\"972\\\" alt=\\\"Fix\\\" src=\\\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1a6090c8-7d65-4804-8c11-c9dacac6cc2a\\\" />\\n\\n## Related Issue\\n\\nhttps://issues.openmrs.org/browse/O3-6097\\n\\n## Other\\n\\nN/A\\n\",\"comments\":[{\"kind\":\"issue_comment\",\"author\":\"greptile-apps\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-12T15:54:33.000Z\",\"state\":null,\"path\":null,\"line\":null,\"body\":\"<!-- greptile_summary -->\\n\\n<h2><a href=\\\"https://app.greptile.com/api/retrigger?id=79229397\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/RetriggerDark.svg?v=2\\\"><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\\\"><img alt=\\\"Retrigger\\\" src=\\\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\\\" align=\\\"right\\\"></picture></a>Confidence Score: 5/5</h2>\\n\\n**[Low impact]** This PR appears safe to merge.\\n\\n<details open><summary><h3>Summary</h3></summary>\\n\\nNo actionable issues found.\\n- The free-text dosage switch shows the label for its current 